200 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 156 0 R
/E (The Mutual Fund Analytics Platform is a data analytics and business intelligence solution developed to analyze mutual fund industry trends, fund performance, investor behavior, and SIP growth patterns. The project integrates 10 financial datasets and applies ETL, data cleaning, SQL analytics, and advanced performance metrics such as CAGR, Sharpe Ratio, Sortino Ratio, Alpha, and Beta. Interactive Power BI dashboards were developed to provide insights into industry growth, fund performance, investor transactions, and market trends. The platform transforms raw financial data into actionable insights that support data-driven investment analysis and decision-making.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
